WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.776
Quad9 is switching

00:00:01.588 --> 00:00:02.390
off in France

00:00:02.201 --> 00:00:02.791
today

00:00:03.318 --> 00:00:06.195
Today November 24, 2026

00:00:06.349 --> 00:00:07.775
Quad9 will disable

00:00:07.587 --> 00:00:08.636
its services for

00:00:08.448 --> 00:00:09.402
French users

00:00:09.592 --> 00:00:10.570
starting at 9

00:00:10.382 --> 00:00:11.183
in the morning

00:00:11.195 --> 00:00:12.162
Paris time

00:00:12.694 --> 00:00:13.826
The morning timing

00:00:13.637 --> 00:00:14.474
is deliberate

00:00:14.510 --> 00:00:15.583
to give unaware

00:00:15.394 --> 00:00:16.526
users a chance

00:00:16.338 --> 00:00:17.481
to react during

00:00:17.293 --> 00:00:18.342
business hours

00:00:18.878 --> 00:00:19.856
From then on

00:00:20.057 --> 00:00:21.189
any query reaching

00:00:21.001 --> 00:00:22.403
a Quad9 address

00:00:22.215 --> 00:00:23.264
will be refused

00:00:23.418 --> 00:00:24.503
and no DNS

00:00:24.314 --> 00:00:25.835
resolution will succeed

00:00:26.024 --> 00:00:27.439
while Quad9 points

00:00:27.251 --> 00:00:30.257
users to 9.9.9.10

00:00:30.505 --> 00:00:31.495
its address with

00:00:31.307 --> 00:00:32.274
no blocking at

00:00:32.086 --> 00:00:32.675
all

00:00:33.198 --> 00:00:34.212
Full story on

00:00:34.023 --> 00:00:34.919
the dashboard
